# Trivy Ignore File — Transaction Shield
#
# Add CVE IDs here to suppress known false positives or accepted risks.
# Each entry must be reviewed and re-approved every 90 days.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # Reason | Reviewed: YYYY-MM-DD | Expires: YYYY-MM-DD
#
# Current policy:
#   - CRITICAL CVEs: must have a remediation plan within 7 days
#   - HIGH CVEs in base image with no upstream fix: suppress after review
#   - All suppressions require a GitHub issue reference
#
# Example:
#   CVE-2023-12345  # Alpine musl - not exploitable in JRE-only container | 2026-05-30 | expires 2026-08-30
